mponent-close --></div><span style="white-space: pre-line;" data-testid="aspect-summary" class="aui-primitive __P0nNOOvpt01x __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">Customers have mixed experiences with the slicer's performance: while some say it chops very nicely and does a good job with onions, others report that it doesn't perform as advertised and can be dangerous, with one customer mentioning it sliced their finger badly.</span><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z __P0nNOOKHIwIJ"><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=SnippetList-p7YoaSkonpmESLV k-id=6fb8baea-32f2-424d-b157-5e6365fe702a k-composed=SnippetList_asp_100_25 k-parent=a7b54bb5-bff7-4bc4-afb7-f03840a4bcfd k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z"><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand=snippet_36_21 k-id=f5ad6c45-9c30-42f2-8188-dad54d7b8289 k-parent=6fb8baea-32f2-424d-b157-5e6365fe702a k-data=[omitted] k-init--><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z __P0nNOOvpt01x"><div data-csa-c-type="uxElement" data-csa-c-item-id="cr-product-insights-detail-page_read-more-link" data-csa-c-pos="" data-csa-c-posx="" data-csa-c-posy="" data-csa-c-owner="CustomerReviews" data-csa-c-item-type="" data-csa-c-parent-element-id="" class="aui-primitive" data-csa-c-slot-id="cr-product-insights-detail-page_read-more-link" data-csa-c-id="bax1tb-gg12xx-3f38fm-8ucnfi"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">"</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">...Pros: good for men or women with strong hands. </span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ __SARCET4AB">Chops great</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">! Easy to store. Great for parties or chefs. Cons: not good for the weak....</span></span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">"</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive"> </span><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=TextLink-vGphR3AGo9p_JGZ k-id=c3abcdeb-b8e0-46eb-9801-df3c6a91d824 k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-var-addr=/MainView_summar_101_5/aspectReadMoreE_310_13/BottomSheetCont_213_21/aspect_72_22/5/SnippetList_asp_100_25/snippet_36_21/0/TextLinkTemplat_57_25/mouseHover_37_11 k-expand-let=mouseHover_37_11 k-parent=c3abcdeb-b8e0-46eb-9801-df3c6a91d824 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=hoverStyles_62_5 k-parent=c3abcdeb-b8e0-46eb-9801-df3c6a91d824 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=TextLink-IWeWkF6_RIMoPt5 k-id=a2c60b0d-45d7-46d2-a489-1b6d731fc3b0 k-composed=TextLinkPrimiti_111_1 k-parent=c3abcdeb-b8e0-46eb-9801-df3c6a91d824 k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=shouldStopPropa_51_5 k-parent=a2c60b0d-45d7-46d2-a489-1b6d731fc3b0 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=targetStr_59_5 k-parent=a2c60b0d-45d7-46d2-a489-1b6d731fc3b0 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-var-addr=/MainView_summar_101_5/aspectReadMoreE_310_13/BottomSheetCont_213_21/aspect_72_22/5/SnippetList_asp_100_25/snippet_36_21/0/TextLinkTemplat_57_25/TextLinkPrimiti_111_1/pressed_61_11 k-expand-let=pressed_61_11 k-parent=a2c60b0d-45d7-46d2-a489-1b6d731fc3b0 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=hrefStr_84_5 k-parent=a2c60b0d-45d7-46d2-a489-1b6d731fc3b0 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=useHref_85_5 k-parent=a2c60b0d-45d7-46d2-a489-1b6d731fc3b0 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><a href="https://