tive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">"</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">...I’m super disappointed because it </span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ __SARCET4AB">chops well</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">. If I had used it for a year maybe I’d expect it, but one month?!? Also just outside of return window.</span></span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">"</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive"> </span><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=TextLink-vGphR3AGo9p_JGZ k-id=e32cc28a-1e72-4bf3-81d6-58bea71e4fe2 k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-var-addr=/MainView_summar_101_5/aspectReadMoreE_310_13/BottomSheetCont_213_21/aspect_72_22/5/SnippetList_asp_100_25/snippet_36_21/1/TextLinkTemplat_57_25/mouseHover_37_11 k-expand-let=mouseHover_37_11 k-parent=e32cc28a-1e72-4bf3-81d6-58bea71e4fe2 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=hoverStyles_62_5 k-parent=e32cc28a-1e72-4bf3-81d6-58bea71e4fe2 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=TextLink-IWeWkF6_RIMoPt5 k-id=5e5061ea-38cc-4225-8dba-f5991cdecc87 k-composed=TextLinkPrimiti_111_1 k-parent=e32cc28a-1e72-4bf3-81d6-58bea71e4fe2 k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=shouldStopPropa_51_5 k-parent=5e5061ea-38cc-4225-8dba-f5991cdecc87 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=targetStr_59_5 k-parent=5e5061ea-38cc-4225-8dba-f5991cdecc87 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-var-addr=/MainView_summar_101_5/aspectReadMoreE_310_13/BottomSheetCont_213_21/