ce_tmp_154_55" k-aria-disabled="tmpCoalesce_tmp_155_55" k-style="inlineStyles_160_3" k-class="mergedStyles_161_3" onclick="" k-init="" k-bound=""><img src="./fullstar-chopper_files/FQQMS6xydSSApTa.png" k-metric-loaded-enabled="false" aria-hidden="true" style="display:inline-block;height:12px;width:12px;object-fit:cover;" class="aui-primitive __HcWIi-bS7X-z"></button><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --></div><span style="white-space: pre-line;" data-testid="aspect-summary" class="aui-primitive __P0nNOOvpt01x __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">Customers have mixed experiences with the sharpness of the slicer, with some finding the blades very sharp and staying that way, while others report that they become dull over time.</span><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z __P0nNOOKHIwIJ"><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=SnippetList-p7YoaSkonpmESLV k-id=10137631-bd37-400d-a6b9-2eba240e2344 k-composed=SnippetList_asp_100_25 k-parent=c55bed19-bc3c-40cd-bf1d-92e04dca63c4 k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z"><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand=snippet_36_21 k-id=9b524f52-5406-4b79-a4f5-f4d72edca884 k-parent=10137631-bd37-400d-a6b9-2eba240e2344 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z __P0nNOOvpt01x"><div data-csa-c-type="uxElement" data-csa-c-item-id="cr-product-insights-detail-page_read-more-link" data-csa-c-pos="" data-csa-c-posx="" data-csa-c-posy="" data-csa-c-owner="CustomerReviews" data-csa-c-item-type="" data-csa-c-parent-element-id="" class="aui-primitive" data-csa-c-slot-id="cr-product-insights-detail-page_read-more-link" data-csa-c-id="nxwq51-y2wz8y-all80n-yxtapv"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">"</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">I was actually surprised how sturdy and </span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ __SARCET4AB">sharp</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ"> (yes, I did cut myself!) this chopper is. Went thru onions and carrots quite easily on my first try....</span></span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">"</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive"> </span><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=TextLink-vGphR3AGo9p_JGZ k-id=fc3b9916-3a86-45b0-97dd-a064d8c0389b k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-var-addr=/MainView_summar_101_5/aspectReadMoreE_310_13/BottomSheetCont_213_21/aspect_72_22/7/SnippetList_asp_100_25/snippet_36_21/0/TextLinkTemplat_57_25/mouseHover_37_11 k-expand-let=mouseHover_37_11 k-parent=fc3b9916-3a86-45b0-97dd-a064d8c0389b k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=hoverStyles_62_5 k-parent=fc3b9916-3a86-45b0-97dd-a064d8c0389b k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=TextLink-IWeWkF6_RIMoPt5 k-id=638c8c0a-5db9-4144-a66e-f688f75abc78 k-composed=TextLinkPrimiti_111_1 k-parent=fc3b9916-3a86-45b0-97dd-a064d8c0389b k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=shouldStopPropa_51_5 k-parent=638c8c0a-5db9-4144-a66e-f688f75abc78 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=targetStr_59_5 k-parent=638c8c0a-5db9-4144-a66e-f688f75abc78 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-var-addr=/MainView_summar_101_5/aspectReadMoreE_310_13/BottomSheetCont_213_21/aspect_72_22/7/SnippetList_asp_100_25/snippet_36_21/0/TextLinkTemplat_57_25/TextLinkPrimiti_111_1/pressed_61_11 k-expand-let=pressed_61_11 k-p