rue"></i><div class="a-alert-content">There was a problem filtering reviews. Please reload the page.</div></div></div></div><div id="top-reviews-spinner" class="_Y3Itd_spinner-container_2y2KN aok-hidden"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-none a-padding-none"><div id="localTopReviews" class="_Y3Itd_top-reviews-section_1AqcY"><h3 class="a-spacing-medium a-spacing-top-large">Top reviews from the United States</h3><ul id="localTopReviewsList" data-csa-c-slot-id="cm-cr-dp-review-list" data-csa-c-type="widget" class="a-unordered-list a-nostyle a-vertical" data-csa-c-id="qtim77-c9fbab-tgj05d-gjsfsu"><li><span class="a-list-item"><div data-hook="reviewContainer" data-translatable="false" data-reviewid="R3BXE9QTS3EBOW" data-asin="B0764HS4SL" data-mobile="false" data-locale="en-US" data-localelanguagename="English" data-sourcelanguage="en-US" data-sourcelanguagename="English" data-iscustomerrecognized="true" data-iskindleapp="false" data-isandroidapp="false" data-isiosapp="false" data-ismshop="false" data-marketplaceid="ATVPDKIKX0DER"><div id="R3BXE9QTS3EBOW" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R3BXE9QTS3EBOW" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-hook="review" class="a-section aok-relative" data-csa-c-id="79uvax-oqqocm-grn6zl-y866e4"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFLOG6B5NULA4MJBIOCOYXM67SQQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R3BXE9QTS3EBOW_profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="cpp16j-8ugs0p-nhm20s-jtfp4l"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="./fullstar-chopper_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/7e4f2673-b636-452f-943d-a160c9f0c0b2._CR0%2C0%2C500%2C500_SX460_SX48_.jpg"><noscript><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/7e4f2673-b636-452f-943d-a160c9f0c0b2._CR0%2C0%2C500%2C500_SX460_SX48_.jpg"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">Mary E.</span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3BXE9QTS3EBOW/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">Meal prep just got a lot easier!</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on July 7, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B0764HS4SL/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: White<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Size: 4 in 1</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-2"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-2-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-2-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="basic" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-2-card0" data-csa-c-id="1ruqm7-pfhcfm-2squke-padw6e"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition" style="height: 120px;"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>I've been using this for years &amp; it's still going strong. It's solidly built &amp; my most used kitchen gadget. It takes no time to switch blades and the small footprint is a blessing in my very tiny kitchen. I use it for all my chopping. It makes quick work of salads, sautéed veggies, roasted potatoes, etc. It has made it easier &amp; faster to make healthy homemade meals. I chop veggies &amp; store in mason jars for quick salads, soups or stir fry. We are getting a much wider assortment of veggies in every meal. If this ever does break, I will buy another one immediately. BONUS: it goes right into the dishwasher. Woo-hoo!!</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha a-hidden"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="tlsmln-r5tj9i-zaknf9-gihcmw"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-top-small _Y3Itd_helpful-votes-container_3iphI"><span data-hook="helpful-vote-statement" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">21 people found this helpful</span></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_cr-voting-section_1cNTp"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-button_1u3UK cr-vote-component" data-hook="helpfulVoteButton" data-mix-operations="HelpfulVoteClickHandler" data-asin="B0764HS4SL" data-id="R3BXE9QTS3EBOW" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R3BXE9QTS3EBOW_helpful_button" data-csa-c-id="366e6r-pa2g56-6ik25u-qlr66x"><span class="a-button a-button-base" id="a-autoid-27"><span class="a-button-inner"><input type="submit" class="a-button-input" aria-labelledby="a-autoid-27-announce"><span class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true" id="a-autoid-27-announce"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-text-desktop_2dXQG">Helpful</div></span></span></span></div><span data-hook="helpfulVoteLoadingMessage" class="_Y3Itd_hidden_1J5OD">Sending feedback...</span><div data-hook="helpfulVoteSuccessMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success _Y3Itd_hidden_1J5OD a-spacing-bloc