ata-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R55IZQZG823SF_profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="yls3nr-c74why-7jci81-2zk66k"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="./fullstar-chopper_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"><noscript><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">AarynLynn Abbassi </span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R55IZQZG823SF/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">I cannot say enough, good things about this chopper</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on June 7, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B0764HS4SL/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: White<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Size: 4 in 1</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-3"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-3-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-3-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-3-card0" data-csa-c-id="djrvrg-bll91y-5w0bmk-6a6jyc"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>If you wanna make chopping things simple, this is exactly what you need! Please remember, don’t be fooled, this is super sharp all of the components that cut! Definitely make sure that you use the attic component of the scrub brush to wash the stainless steel, chopping blades, I promise you they’re sharp enough to send you to the hospital if you’re not careful! I use this to chop baby carrots, full-size carrots that I have shaved down and cut down to fit inside the chopper to chop, potatoes that I have peeled and chopped into quarters, and then placed into this to chop to make homemade hash brown O’Brien instead of purchasing it frozen at the store, I chopped onions and peppers as well in this! A large variety of things you can do I absolutely love the interchangeable chopping variety that it gives you, very large accommodating bottom catches all of the chopped food so you could just lift the top off and pour directly into either a bowl, plastic Ziploc bag, right into a skillet whatever it is! This is the second one I have bought and I absolutely love them! Very sturdy and well-made, easy to clean and cut my chopping time down by probably 90%! I highly recommend this to anyone in everyone and in fact I’ve also shared it on my YouTube channel since I am a prepper! The best chopper I have ever used and I probably will buy a third, I gave my first one to my daughter, second one is mine and third will be a back up so that if I need to chop a bunch of things, I can get one of my teenagers in there to help me do so and we can both be chopping at the same time lol</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="v7upp1-ggpbh4-ammper-1fmdpd"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="