                                 <div id="productQuickView_feature_div" class="celwidget" data-feature-name="productQuickView" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-c-content-id="productQuickView" data-csa-c-slot-id="productQuickView_feature_div" data-csa-c-asin="" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row="false" data-csa-c-id="5d08g3-8ir8fh-5yha48-mv6h9" data-cel-widget="productQuickView_feature_div">
                              <div class="a-popover-preload" id="a-popover-pqvOverlay">             <div data-cel-widget="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-content-id="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-slot-id="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-type="popup" class="a-section a-padding-none celwidget" data-csa-c-id="a31mip-7m06c3-93wie1-y8gnq">      <script type="text/javascript">(function(f) {var _np=(window.P._namespace("DetailPagePQVAssets"));if(_np.guardFatal){_np.guardFatal(f)(_np);}else{f(_np);}}(function(P) {
                P.now('pqv').execute(function(pqv) {
                    if (!pqv) {
                        P.register("pqv", function () {
                            return {
                                overlayType: 'desktop'
                            };
                        });
                    }
                });
            }));</script>         <h1 id="pqv-title"> Product Summary: Fullstar Pro Original Vegetable Chopper &amp; Spiralizer, Kitchen Prep Tool | 4 in 1 Veggie Slicer, Onion &amp; Fruit Cutter with Sharp Stainless Steel Blades &amp; Container, All-in-One Food Prep Tool (White) </h1>    <p id="pqv-byline">From fullstar</p>               <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <p id="pqv-ratings" data-target="#averageCustomerReviews_feature_div" class="a-spacing-none">  4.5 out of 5 stars, 95,468 ratings </p> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-reviews-action" data-pqv-reviews-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-reviews" data-target="#customer-reviews_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/Vegetable-Chopper-Spiralizer-Slicer-Choppers/dp/B0764HS4SL?ref=dp_product_quick_view#customer-reviews_feature_div"> Customer reviews </a> </span>   <p id="pqv-bought-in-last-month" data-target="#socialProofingAsinFaceout_feature_div" class="a-spacing-none aok-hidden">1K+ bought in past week</p>  </div>        <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-price"> Price </h2>               <p class="a-spacing-small">              <span class="a-text-bold"> One-time purchase: $29.99 </span>                  40% Savings   </p>         <p id="pqv-price-list-price" data-target="#corePriceDisplay_desktop_feature_div .basisPrice" class="a-spacing-small"> List Price: <span class="a-text-strike"> $49.99 </span> </p>                                                       <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buybox-action" data-pqv-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buybox" data-target="#buybox" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/Vegetable-Chopper-Spiralizer-Slicer-Choppers/dp/B0764HS4SL?ref=dp_product_quick_view#buybox"> Purchasing options </a> </span> </p>                <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buying-options-action" data-pqv-buying-options-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buying-options" data-target="#dynamic-aod-ingress-box" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/Vegetable-Chopper-Spiralizer-Slicer-Choppers/dp/B0764HS4SL?ref=dp_product_quick_view#dynamic-aod-ingress-box"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p> <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-unqualified-buybox-action" data-pqv-unqualified-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-unqualified-buybox" data-target="#unqualifiedBuyBox" class="a-link-normal aok-hidden" href="https://www.amazon.com/Vegetable-Chopper-Spiralizer-Slicer-Choppers/dp/B0764HS4SL?ref=dp_product_quick_view#unqualifiedBuyBox"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p>  </div>         <div id="pqv-feature-bullets" data-target="#featurebullets_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feature-bullets-heading">About this Item</h2> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item">The Original Pro Chopper – Discover TikTok’s favorite veggie chopper and one of the top-rated kitchen gadgets of the season! This 5-cup, large-capacity chopper dices in just 30 seconds—saving you significant time over manual prep. Simple to set up and clean, it’s the ultimate daily kitchen helper. Note: This is our classic dicing model; select our 6-in-1, 8-in-1, or 14-in-1 variations above for mandoline and slicing features!</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Dishwasher Safe (Top Rack) – Done prepping? Simply toss the chopper on the top rack of your dishwasher for a no-scrub cleanup. It’s a clever, convenient choice for birthdays, white elephant gifts, or holiday gifts that will actually get used daily.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Quick Prep, Compact Storage – Perfect for healthy eating on a busy schedule, this chopper features heavy-duty, rust-resistant 420 stainless steel blades that stay razor-sharp. Designed for "grab-and-go" daily use, its compact frame fits neatly in drawers or cabinets with no complicated setup required.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">5-Star Design for Everyday Cooking – Built for comfort and precision, this BPA-free essential features a soft-grip TPU handle and a non-skid rubber base for maximum stability. The built-in catch tray prevents messes and keeps counters clean, making it a stress-free choice for daily meal prep and a perfect housewarming gift.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">The Perfect Kitchen Gift – Whether you’re looking for Mother’s Day gifts or a treat for a seasoned pro, this gadget makes meal prep fast, safe, and fun. It effortlessly handles low-carb prep and family dinners, making it a top-rated gift for moms and a thoughtful gift for anyone who wants to cook smarter, faster, and easier.</span></li>  </ul> </div>           <div id="pqv-description" data-target="#productDescription_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <h2 id="pqv-description-heading">Product Description</h2>    <div>
                    Powerful, compact and convenient the fullstar vegetable chopper is a versatile all-in-one kitchen tool that is perfect for preparing salads, salsa, onions, garlic and more. It delivers fast, consistent results and sports an impressive 4-cup (1. 2L) capacity. Its space-saving design eliminates the need for bulky equipment in small kitchens while its catch tray minimizes messes. The clear body lets you monitor progress as you cut up carrots, cucumbers, squash, zucchini and spices like ginger. Because it requires no electricity, The fullstar vegetable chopper can be used anywhere. Designed for ease of use and durability Our vegetable chopper is made of long-lasting, impact resistant ABS plastic so it withstands the rigors of your busy kitchen. The 4 interchangeable blades are made of heavy-duty, rust resistant stainless steel. They tackle the toughest potatoes and the crunchiest carrots without bending, and they maintain their razor-sharpness use after use. The storage lid has integrated pusher teeth so your hands are never at risk of injury. With 1 Swift lid-closing motion, your vegetables and fruits are sliced, diced and chopped to perfection. When you are finished, add the Full star vegetable chopper to the top rack of your dishwasher for easy clean-up. Customer satisfaction is our top priority fullstar insists on the highest quality materials and manufacturing processes to bring you superior home kitchen accessories. We confidently offer a money back on our vegetable and food chopper. In the unlikely event that it does not perform as promised, return it for a 100% refund of your purchase price. Breeze through the toughest chopping tasks quickly and safely. Add the fullstar manual vegetable chopper to your cart today.  </div>
               </div>                        <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-options-available">Options Available</h2>    <h3>Color</h3> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Black </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Clear </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Stainless Steel </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> White </span></li>  </ul>  <h3>Size</h3> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item"> 2 in 1 </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> 4 in 1 </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> 4 in 1 (Pack of 2) </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> 6 in 1 </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> 8 in 1 </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> 14 in 1 </span></li>  </ul>  <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-twister-action" data-pqv-twister-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-twister" data-target="#twister-plus-inline-twister,#twister" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/Vegetable-Chopper-Spiralizer-Slicer-Choppers/dp/B0764HS4SL?ref=dp_product_quick_view#twister"> Browse all available options </a> </span> </div>                              <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-report-issue-action" data-pqv-report-issue-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-report-issue" data-target="#tellAmazon_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/Vegetable-Chopper-Spiralizer-Slicer-Choppers/dp/B0764HS4SL?ref=dp_product_quick_view#tellAmazon_feature_div"> Report an issue with this product or seller </a> </span> </div>                     <div id="pqv-feedback" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feedback-heading">Feedback</h2> <p>Did you find this product summary feature useful?</p>   <div id="pqv-feedback-buttons-section" class="a-section"> <div class="a-section a-padding-base aok-float-left"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-feedback-positive-action" data-pqv-feedback-positive-action="{}"> <span id="pqv-feedback-positive" class="a-button a-button-base"><span class="a-button-inner"><input id="pqv-feedback-positive-native" aria-described-by="Submit feedback that this product summary is useful" class="a-button-input" type="submit" aria-labelledby="pqv-feedback-positive-announce"><span id="pqv-feedback-positive-announce" class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true"> Yes, it is useful </span></span></span> </span> </div> <div class="a-section a-padding-base"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-feedback-negative-action" data-pqv-feedback-negative-action="{}"> <span id="pqv-feedback-negative" class="a-button a-button-base"><span class="a-button-inner"><input id="pqv-feedback-negative-native" aria-described-by="Submit feedback that this product summary isn&#39;t useful" class="a-button-input" type="submit" aria-labelledby="pqv-feedback-negative-announce"><span id="pqv-feedback-negative-announce" class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true"> No, it is not useful </span></span></span> </span> </div> </div> <div id="pqv-feedback-submit-section" class="a-section aok-hidden"> <div class="a-section a-padding-base aok-float-left"> <div class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success aok-hidden" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content" tabindex="-1"> Thank you for your feedback </div></div></div> <div id="pqv-feedback-message-positive" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success aok-hidden" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content" tabindex="-1"> Thank you for your feedback. You selected "Yes, it is useful" </div></div></div> <div id="pqv-feedback-message-negative" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success aok-hidden" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content" tabindex="-1"> Thank you for your feedback. You selected "No, it is not useful" </div></div></div> </div> <div class="a-section a-padding-base"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-feedback-reset-action" data-pqv-feedback-reset-action="{}"> <span id="pqv-feedback-reset" class="a-button a-button-base aok-hidden"><span class="a-button-inner"><input id="pqv-feedback-reset-native" class="a-button-input" type="submit" aria-labelledby="pqv-feedback-reset-announce"><span id="pqv-feedback-reset-announce" class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true"> Change your feedback </span></span></span> </span> </div> </div>    </div>  <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <hr aria-hidden="true" class="a-divider-normal"> <footer>
        Product summary presents key information. Close to see all product details. </footer>
